NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE only. It does not and cannot relicense the
datasets the application ingests, which remain under their publishers' terms.
No dataset is redistributed in this repository — each is downloaded from its
publisher at build time by `make data-download`.

Every source, its licence and its required attribution are recorded in
`backend/ingest/sources.py`, stored in the `data_sources` table, and served by
the API at `GET /api/sources`. The principal ones are:

  HM Land Registry Price Paid Data   Open Government Licence v3.0
                                     Contains HM Land Registry data (c) Crown
                                     copyright and database right. This data is
                                     licensed under the Open Government Licence
                                     v3.0.
  France geo-DVF                     Licence Ouverte 2.0
  Ireland Property Price Register    CC BY 4.0
  Statistics Netherlands (CBS)       CC BY 4.0
  Statistics Sweden (SCB)            CC0 1.0
  Statistics Denmark                 CC BY 4.0
  Australian Bureau of Statistics    CC BY 4.0
  Singapore HDB / data.gov.sg        Singapore Open Data Licence 1.0
  US Census Bureau / FHFA            Public domain (17 U.S.C. section 105)
  Eurostat                           Eurostat open data policy
  Natural Earth                      Public domain
  OpenStreetMap / Nominatim          ODbL 1.0

Anyone deploying this must keep the attributions the API returns visible in the
interface, as several of those licences require.
